# Finder sidebar Favorites, top to bottom.
# The check reads FavoriteItems.sfl4 (or .sfl3, or .sfl2) and compares file
# favorites with this list. A trailing slash is not a difference. Nothing
# writes the sidebar file. mysides is not used.
# Format: name | path
#   path is absolute, or starts with @HOME@ (that becomes $HOME).
# Blank lines and lines beginning with # are ignored.
Applications|/Applications
Desktop|@HOME@/Desktop
Developer|@HOME@/Developer
Documents|@HOME@/Documents
Downloads|@HOME@/Downloads
Movies|@HOME@/Movies
Music|@HOME@/Music
Pictures|@HOME@/Pictures
